    h1: `Graph Intelligence for Fraud Detection: Why Payment Aggregators Need More Than Rule-Based Systems`,
    metaDesc: `Rule-based fraud detection was never built for organized fraud rings. Payment aggregators need graph intelligence to see what rules cannot - the network behind the merchant. Here is why the architecture matters.`,
    primaryKeywords: [`graph intelligence fraud detection`, `payment aggregator fraud detection`, `fraud ring detection`, `network risk intelligence PSP`],
